div.div:
LLM #1 — _MATCH_PROMPT
You are a skill router.
Does the goal match a predefined skill (≥80%)?
User goal: {goal}
Available skills:
- {name}: {description}
Return: {"match": "skill_name"} or {"match": null}

LLM #2 — _PLAN_PROMPT
You are a task planner.
needs_plan=true: multiple independent ops /
sequential steps / >5 tool calls
needs_plan=false: simple Q&A / single-file /
lookup task
Goal: {goal}
Return:
{"needs_plan": false, "steps": []}
{"needs_plan": true, "steps": [{"desc": ..., "depends_on": []}]}

LLM extra — _REPLAN_PROMPT
A step has failed. Decide how to adjust.
Overall goal: {goal}
Completed steps:
[{index}] {desc}: {result[:100]}
Failed step:
[{index}] {desc}: {error[:200]}
Return:
{"action": "skip"}
{"action": "retry", "desc": "new desc"}
{"action": "replace", "steps": [...]}
